= The editor
VeraBASIC is the editor and the runtime in one program: you write a program,
check it, run it and come back to it without leaving. It opens .bas files: a
double click on one in the shell starts it, and File > Open finds them with
their long names. VeraBASIC Run stays for finished programs: the program
documents vbasic.py build makes.

@{The window}
@{Colours}
@{Typing}
@{Files}
@{Check, Run, Stop}
